
 MC/FEP simulation for tetramethylammonium ion -> neopentane
 in polarizable liquid benzene (N = 260).

 The job can be run in this directory via 
 cp tmaneo.z fepzmat
 csh -e fepcmd >& log &

 or on the queuing system via
 xFEPQ tmaneo
 The results are then in the directory tmaneo.fep

 Then execute xSUMDELG to yield
 sumout which contains a summary of the deltaG results.

 to display a plot file, e.g.,
 x f005plte10

